.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH pacquery 1  "pacquery " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pacquery \- A CLI tool to provide JSON of provided pacman package(s).
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBpacquery\fR [\fB\-\-repos\fR] [\fB\-\-dbpath\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPKGNAMES\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
A CLI tool to provide JSON of provided pacman package(s).
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-repos\fR \fI<REPOS>\fR [default: core,extra,multilib]
Repositories
.TP
\fB\-\-dbpath\fR \fI<DBPATH>\fR
The path to the pacman database, default ( /var/lib/pacman )
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPKGNAMES\fR>
List of input packages
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
Jelle van der Waa <jelle@archlinux.org>
